optimization, payroll tax strategy, and multi-state tax planning. Rachel holds an MS in Taxation from Golden Gate University and a BS in Accounting from the University of Illinois Urbana-Champaign. She is an active member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Illinois CPA Society. Before joining TheTaxCalc, Rachel spent 8 years at a Big Four accounting firm advising high-net-worth clients on tax-efficient wealth strategies.\",\"knowsAbout\":[\"Federal Income Tax\",\"State Income Tax\",\"FICA Tax\",\"Payroll Tax\",\"IRS Compliance\",\"Tax Planning\",\"Multi-State Taxation\",\"Tax-Advantaged Accounts\"],\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rachelmitchellcpa/\",\"https://www.aicpa-cima.com/\"],\"worksFor\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"TheTaxCalc\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com\"},\"image\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/author-rachel-mitchell.webp\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/no-tax-on-overtime-guide-2026#article\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"No Tax on Overtime: How the New Law Saves You Money (2025–2028)\",\"description\":\"Complete guide to the No Tax on Overtime law for 2025-2028. Calculate your savings, understand eligibility, and see how FICA and state taxes still apply. Free calculator.\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/opengraph-image.png\",\"width\":1200,\"height\":630},\"datePublished\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-06-01T12:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/no-tax-on-overtime-guide-2026#author\"},\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/no-tax-on-overtime-guide-2026\"},\"keywords\":[\"no tax on overtime\",\"overtime tax exemption\",\"overtime pay\",\"OT tax savings\",\"trump tax law\",\"2026\"],\"wordCount\":3896,\"articleSection\":\"Tax Guide\"},{\"@id\":\"https://thetaxcalc.com/blog/no-tax-on-ove